197: 
198: [O] Today `full-pipeline` means a Private Candidate passes review, then `posse validate test`, `docs` and `lint`, before every publication (`CONTEXT.md`, Review Mode). [O] Those three stages record what the Worker claims it ran (report section G). [O] ADR 0028 already makes forge CI at the recorded head the verification for PR delivery and states that local delivery has no automated verification.
